{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/minimumCut(capacity:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A global minimum cut over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"directedView"},{"type":"text","text":", or nil below two vertices."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols\/graph\/minimumcut(capacity:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cut","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/Cut"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedView"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Comparable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cut minimizes the capacity of the edges between a nonempty proper vertex set and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest. The side holding the first vertex is the source side. Computed by Nagamochi–Ibaraki:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maximum adjacency orderings that contract every edge whose scanned connection is at least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the best cut so far. Which minimum cut is returned when several exist is unspecified, but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same input always gives the same cut."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the edges of positive capacity do not connect the graph, the result is the cut of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value zero whose source side is the first vertex’s component, with every crossing edge.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Parallel capacities add and self-loops are ignored. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"text":" is called once per non-loop","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge, in position order, before any work.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sums are formed in a wider type than ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" where needed (","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int128","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for fixed-width","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"code":"Float","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so a contracted group’s connection may exceed ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s range.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(nm log n) in the worst case.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every capacity is at least zero, not NaN and finite, and the minimum cut’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value fits in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" (it is at most every vertex’s capacity sum)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Precondition","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Flows","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5FlowsE10minimumCut8capacityAD0E0VyAA12DirectedViewVyxGqd__GSgqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_ts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cut","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV"},{"kind